msgid "⟪k:0⟫The eldest, Didier, belonged to an order of knights that served the Church."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫長兄のディディエは教会に属する騎士の拝命を控えていた。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_5CE21799_E4B2_4AA3_AFB1_271B4FB2579C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1481c337ecd512cb0641f9402356a5dd771c535debccca126b21d629c9a11e4
