msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was, in all likelihood, who would inherit the family estate,⟪k:1⟫as knights were not "
"formally allowed to own property."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫恐らく、⟪k:1⟫この家の財産を継ぐのは次兄のジョルジュだろう。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫形式的に、⟪k:4⟫騎士は財"
"産の所有を許されていなかったから。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_7B2E246B_09D9_4CC7_BC27_FC94313AEFE1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d248f0d26733980588929da82af67b2a209b9aca49aefc0a9b9dc3e9bb6626e
