msgid "⟪k:0⟫Was it because her world was so isolated?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫―――母の世界が閉鎖的だったから？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_95F238EC_04F7_413B_879C_FB93DADD6EC0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33b332d35f14318b4127afa20d1bbdb1ab23e6731783a62e974c088cf78fa30e
