msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CE2E1D09_66F6_435B_A47D_178C1499ECE6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But above all, she loved to say,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫何より、⟪k:1⟫母はことあるごとに告げる。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_40CC3113_166E_4F46_AB19_9B65026E3104
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08ffeb45e6f4ae0efdc1f121ac39bdf10f89acc507291f91e5658820e993aaef
